# The engineering is the portfolio; the working notes are not.
#
# `docs/plan.md` is the implementation plan and its log: 2,000 lines of
# task-by-task steps plus the eight deviations found while executing them, each
# with the measurement that exposed it. It is honest and it is useful, and it is
# also scaffolding — a reader arriving at this repository should meet the design
# and the code, not the ladder used to build them.
#
# It stays on disk. `docs/design.md` stays in the repository, because that one is
# the spec: the disposition table lives there and CONTRIBUTING points at it.
docs/plan.md

